Would you like to learn the controls?
- YESS!
- Yes
Go to pink square to start.\
Left click - Attack\
Q - Special Ability\
E - Ultimate Ability\
\

I - Inventory\
Shift - Dodge\
Heal Button - Heal\
B - Recall back to hub
Once you kill enough enemies and the purple bar is full, click on the chest to open it and you get a choice of 3 items.\
Certain items in your inventory will combine into even more powerful items! Experiment to find them all.\
